      en: ["The park is situated in the heart of Lomé, near major administrative buildings.", "It was established in the 1970s as a gesture of international friendship.", "Admission is generally free and open to the public.", "Numerous benches and shaded areas provide space for relaxation.", "The vegetation includes various species of palms and acacias.", "On weekends, the park becomes a hub for informal sports and yoga sessions."],
